Fab OS hardware integration (fabos-hardware)
Copyright 2026 Patience AI and Fab OS contributors.

This package carries only Fab OS configuration and packaging: the dependency
set for fingerprint readers, cameras and microphones, the PAM profile
activation, and the Fab OS name rule for the camera application.
License: Apache License 2.0 (see /usr/share/doc/fabos-branding/copyright).

